===Fly, Fly Away===
In the eastern part of the route, use {{m|Cut}} on the small tree to reach the secluded northern area. Enter the house beyond the gate and speak to the girl inside. She prefers to spend time on her own and gives you {{HM|02|Fly}} to keep her hideaway a secret. Using Fly in the field allows a Trainer to instantly travel to any city or town that had been visited previously.



==Route 17==
The bridges of {{rt|17|Kanto}} pass over the ocean on the way downhill to {{rt|18|Kanto}}. Anyone riding a Bicycle on the Cycling Road who stops pedaling will roll southward, unless the A or B Buttons are held.

