===Share the Wealth===
Enter the gate and speak to another of [[Professor Oak]]'s [[Professor's assistant|aides]]. If you have caught at least 50 different species, the professor has asked him to give you an [[Exp. Share]]. When held by a Pokémon in your party, his item distributes [[Experience|Experience Points]] to the holder whether they participate in the battle or not, but reduces the number of points for Pokémon that do participate.

